  "prefLabel": "Env-A 102.12 Affected unit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 102.12 “Affected unit” means “affected unit” as defined in section 402 of the Act, namely “a unit that is subject to emission reduction requirements or limitations under this title.”\n\nSource. #6057-A, eff 6-30-95; renumbered by #8256 (from Env-A 101.15); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.13 (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
